# The watch of 03, of every kind, read through the additive proxy: the host sends bytes this client does not
# know at the end of each message, an op it does not have, an event of a kind it does not have
# after each event, and an error code it does not have.
@proxy newer
ping
load_plugin {plugin}
put_graph boom {graphs}/boom.json
watch 1 all
start boom
feed 1 in u32:1
step 1 1
next 1
next 1
next 1
next 1
take 9 out
trace 2
